      "title": "Setup and model downloads",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## h3 ref2va balance\n\n1. Install WeeTodd Nodes and restart ComfyUI.\n2. Download the H3 components listed below.\n3. Keep the relative Component Loader paths unchanged.\n4. Select the required images and required video or audio source in ComfyUI.\n5. Queue the workflow after **H3 Preflight** succeeds.\n\n### H3 downloads\n\n- [Official MiniMax H3 partition, processor, tokenizer, and audio VAE](https://huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3)\n  Save the repository under `ComfyUI/models/MiniMax-H3`.\n\n### Required LoRA\n\n- [drbaph v4 step-600 EMA adapter](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora-ComfyUI/blob/main/minimax_h3_turbo_v4_step600_ema_pruned_comfyui.safetensors)\n- Save it as `ComfyUI/models/loras/minimax_h3_turbo_v4_step600_ema_pruned_comfyui.safetensors`.\n\nUse a genuine Ref2VA partition for strict Ref2VA workflows.\nDo not substitute FL2VA weights unless the workflow enables compatibility mode."
      ],
      "color": "#243447",
      "bgcolor": "#15202b"
    }
